OL,3,ARadio presenter's 'wobbles' over
OL,4,AChildren in Need cycling challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith just 19 days to go before he is
OL,7,Fdue to set off, he told colleague Sara
OL,8,FCox on the BBC Radio 2 Breakfast Show
OL,9,Fon Wednesday he was "so not ready".
